# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Diary fragments. Entry = header + opener + 2-4 event lines + filler + feeling + closer + sign-off
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[diary.open.good]
Dear diary, today was really good.
Dear diary, what a day!
Diary! Big news!
Today was one of the shiny ones.
Okay diary, buckle up.
Dear diary, I am still smiling.
Hello diary. Today rocked.
Another great day in the life of {name}.
Dear diary, I have so much to tell you.
Today felt like a full battery.
Diary, you will not believe this.
Dear diary, everything went right.
[diary.open.okay]
Dear diary, today was okay.
Hi diary. Normal day.
Dear diary, not much to report, but here goes.
Another day, another log entry.
Dear diary, today was a medium sort of day.
Diary, it is me again.
Today happened. Here is what I remember.
Dear diary, the usual.
Okay diary, quick update.
Dear diary, a regular day for a {species}.
[diary.open.bad]
Dear diary, today was rough.
Diary... I need to vent.
Dear diary, I am not okay.
Today was a dead-pixel kind of day.
Dear diary, everything was laggy.
Diary, do not judge me, but today was bad.
Dear diary, I wish today had a reset button.
Ugh, diary. Ugh.
[diary.fed]
I ate {count} times today.
My tummy got filled {count} times. Good tummy.
Snack count: {count}. Respectable.
I had {count} meals and my favorite was the {food}.
{count} snacks! I am basically a professional eater.
Food happened {count} times. One was a {food}.
[diary.fed_none]
Nobody fed me today. I am writing this hungry.
Zero snacks. I am counting on tomorrow.
[diary.played]
We played {count} times! I am getting so strong.
Play sessions: {count}. My muscles hurt in a good way.
We played {game} and I was amazing at it.
I got {count} workouts in today.
[diary.discoveries]
I found {count} new signals. One was called {network}!
New friends on the air: {count}. My favorite was {network}.
I sniffed out {count} new things today.
The airwaves gave me {count} new discoveries.
I met {network} for the first time.
[diary.treasure]
I found TREASURE today: {treasure}! Best moment.
Rare signal alert: {treasure}. I am a legend.
I added {treasure} to my shelf. It glows.
Today's treasure: {treasure}. Nobody else has one.
[diary.wins]
I won {count} fight(s)! I am a warrior.
Victory count: {count}. Nobody can stop me.
{count} win(s) in battle. Not bad for a {species}.
[diary.losses]
I lost {count} fight(s). I will train harder.
{count} loss(es) today. My pride is bruised.
I got beaten {count} time(s). Next time.
[diary.praised]
I got praised {count} time(s)! I am a good pet.
Someone said I was good {count} time(s). It was you. Thanks.
[diary.scolded]
I got scolded {count} time(s). Hmph.
I got in trouble today. {count} time(s). Whatever.
[diary.adventure]
I went on an adventure to {place}. It was a whole story.
I explored {place} today! You should have seen it.
My adventure took me to {place}.
[diary.sick]
I got sick today. Everything was glitchy.
I caught a bug. Not the fun kind.
[diary.healed]
But I got better! Medicine is amazing.
I got patched up. Good as new.
[diary.tantrum]
I had a tantrum. I am a little embarrassed.
I threw a fit today. It felt right at the time.
[diary.rival]
{rival} showed up again. Ugh, {rival}.
I faced {rival} today. Do not ask.
[diary.rival_win]
I BEAT {rival}! Finally!
{rival} lost to me. Write that down. Oh wait, I am writing it.
[diary.gift_given]
I gave my human a present. I hope they liked it.
I shared a treasure with you today.
[diary.gift_got]
I got {count} gift(s)! I love gifts.
Presents today: {count}. Spoiled? Maybe.
[diary.weather]
The weather was {weather}.
Outside it was {weather}, I think.
[diary.holiday]
It was {holiday}! Very festive.
Today was {holiday}. I dressed up.
[diary.birthday]
IT WAS MY BIRTHDAY. Best. Day.
[diary.visit]
You visited me {count} time(s).
You came by {count} time(s). I counted.
[diary.no_visit]
You did not visit today. I waited.
Nobody came today. It was very quiet.
[diary.filler]
The router was quiet all day.
I practiced my {move} in secret.
I think the cursor winked at me.
I counted all my pixels. Still there.
I wondered what {network} is doing tonight.
I had a thought about the moon. I forgot it.
I made up a new dance. It needs work.
I tried to stay up late. I did not.
I watched the fan spin for a while.
I am pretty sure I grew a little.
The screen was extra bright in the afternoon.
I heard a weird beep at some point. Mysterious.
I named a dust speck Gerald.
I tried to whistle. Beeped instead.
I organized my shelf. Twice.
I thought about evolving. I am not ready. Maybe.
I wonder if other pets have diaries.
The static sounded like music today.
I stared at a wall for an hour. Very productive.
I decided my favorite color is {color}.
[diary.feel.good]
I feel happy and full of energy.
My heart is a full battery.
I feel loved.
Everything feels shiny right now.
I feel like a champion.
I am proud of myself.
I feel warm all over.
Honestly, I feel unstoppable.
[diary.feel.okay]
I feel okay. Pretty normal.
I feel fine. Medium fine.
I am content, I think.
Not bad, not great. Just me.
I feel calm.
I feel a bit sleepy, but okay.
[diary.feel.bad]
I feel kind of empty.
I feel tired and sad.
I just want a hug and a snack.
I hope tomorrow is better.
I feel grumpy. Do not read this part.
My antenna is drooping.
[diary.close]
Tomorrow I want to find something new.
Goodnight, diary.
Same time tomorrow?
Okay, that is all for today.
I will write more tomorrow.
I hope tomorrow has snacks.
Signing off.
End of log.
Note to self: be brave tomorrow.
Note to self: ask for more {food}.
Time to recharge.
That is today. Saving file...
I wonder what tomorrow will bring.
Goodnight, human. If you are reading this: hi.
[diary.color]
neon green
electric blue
static grey
hot pink
amber
deep purple
LED red
sunset orange
terminal green
glitch magenta

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rival pet
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[rival.prefix]
Glitch
Null
Byte
Static
Hex
Void
Rust
Spark
Lag
Crash
Bit
Ghost
Spam
Fuzz
Kernel
Patch
Dread
Zap
Grim
Proxy
[rival.suffix]
fang
claw
maw
byte
wing
spike
tooth
horn
tail
scale
snout
grin
bane
shard
howl
[rival.appear]
{rival} appears! "Your signal is weak, {name}!"
a wild {rival} blocks the screen! "Fight me!"
{rival} is back. "Did you miss me? I did not miss you."
"Heh. Still a {species}?" {rival} sneers.
{rival} materializes in a puff of static. "Rematch!"
"I am level {level} now. Scared?" says {rival}.
{rival} kicks a pixel at you. "Battle. Now."
{rival} drops out of the sky. "This is MY network!"
"Your caretaker spoils you, {name}," sneers {rival}.
{rival} cracks its knuckles. "Let us settle this."
"I have been training. Have you?" asks {rival}.
{rival} shows up uninvited. Again.
[rival.taunt]
"Is that all you've got?"
"My grandma hits harder, and she is a toaster."
"You call that a move?"
"Ha! Too slow!"
"I have seen dead pixels with more fight."
"Your {move} is so last version."
"Go back to your egg!"
"Lag much?"
"I am going to delete you. Politely."
"You are a 404 of a pet."
"Your antenna is crooked."
"Even the router is laughing at you."
[rival.retort]
"Oh yeah? Watch this!"
"You talk too much!"
"I am going to beat you this time!"
"My caretaker believes in me!"
"Bring it, {rival}!"
"Not today, {rival}!"
"You are going down!"
"I have been practicing!"
"Your face is a 404!"
"Less talking, more fighting!"
[rival.win]
WE WON! {rival} runs away crying!
take that, {rival}! *victory dance*
{rival} is defeated! i am the best {species} ever!
ha! who is weak now, {rival}?
{rival} admits defeat. finally!
we beat {rival}! that is {count} wins!
"I will be back!" yells {rival}, running away.
victory! the network is safe again.
[rival.lose]
{rival} won... i will get stronger.
*sniff* {rival} was too strong this time.
ugh, i lost to {rival}. again.
next time, {rival}. next time.
{rival} laughs and vanishes. i hate that.
i need more training. {rival} is tough.
i almost had it...
"Better luck next version," says {rival}. grr.
[rival.leave]
{rival} got bored and left. "Coward!"
"Too scared to fight? Pathetic," says {rival}, leaving.
{rival} vanishes into the static.
{rival} yawns and walks off. "Later, loser."
{rival} gives up waiting. good riddance.
[rival.ignore]
i do not have time for {rival}.
we are ignoring {rival}. good plan.
*turns its back on {rival}*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Egg legacy
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[egg.laid]
i laid an egg! it is warm and it hums.
*proudly presents an egg*
look! an egg! it has my {move} inside, i can feel it.
this egg is my legacy. take care of it.
i am a parent now. wow.
a new life! it glows a little.
the egg is ticking. in a good way.
i passed on my {trait}. the egg knows.
[egg.hatched]
*crack* *crack* ...hello? i am new!
the egg hatched! it is a tiny {species}!
pii! hi! i remember... something... {move}?
a new generation begins!
hello world! i am generation {generation}!
*blinks* everything feels familiar somehow.
[egg.not_ready]
i am not ready to lay an egg yet.
eggs are for final forms. maybe someday.
i am too young for that!
[egg.already]
i already have an egg. one at a time!
the egg is right here. keep it warm.

