# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Combat flavor
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[combat.angry]
{name} is FURIOUS and hits extra hard!
*seething static* {name} puts everything into {move}!
{name} is mad, and the {foe} is going to feel it.
rage mode! {move} lands with a crunch!
{name} growls and swings harder than usual.
[combat.tired_miss]
{name} is too sleepy to aim...
*yawns mid-attack*
{name}'s eyes droop and the {move} goes wide.
[combat.refuse]
{name} refuses to fight right now.
*sits down in the middle of the dungeon*
{name} shakes its head. "nope."
{name} is too grumpy and tired to listen.
{name} turns its back on the {foe}.
[combat.disobey]
{name} ignores you and uses {move} instead!
"i know what i am doing!" {name} uses {move}.
{name} does its own thing: {move}!
{name} pretends not to hear and picks {move}.
[combat.crit]
lucky hit! {name}'s bond with you makes it strike true!
CRITICAL! {name} felt you cheering!
a perfect hit! {name} winks at you.
[combat.tantrum]
{name} is throwing a tantrum and will not fight.
*pouts* {name} crosses its arms.
